    extra={
      'freezing-rain':'CURRENT MOVEMENT PRECISION: The first continuous voluntary movement segment contacting a covered surface is tested after five actual feet of that covered segment, or at its earlier voluntary stopping point if shorter. Frame subdivisions do not count as stopping. Moving only one foot and stopping consumes the one actual slip opportunity after that foot; splitting the input into smaller movement commands cannot postpone the check past a completed segment. Ordinary difficult-terrain movement cost is paid for the actual distance, and failure then applies actual Prone without refund. This clarifies the earlier up-to-five-feet phrase and is NEW proposed timing.',
      'vitriolic-sphere':'CURRENT DELAYED-POOL PRECISION: At this cast’s single original future caster START or fixed outside-initiative deadline, snapshot the same still-valid due attached recipients and their actual suppression. If at least one has an operative due packet, generate one private 5d4 pool for this cast and apply each recipient’s stored save factor and current defenses. A suppressed recipient consumes its one opportunity without receiving the pool; if no recipient has an operative packet, no damage pool is needed. No public output distinguishes an empty, hidden, suppressed or destroyed recipient list. Caster death does not reset or cancel this nonconcentration rider; ended recipient identity does. These are NEW source-specific engine completion choices, not a global empty-area rule.',
      'mass-decay':'CURRENT ORDINAL-RNG COMPLETION — NEW: Key each private cached 2d6 by original cast ID and ordinal1/2/3. Generate it only when the first still-present recipient actually reaches that ordinal with an unsuppressed operative packet; current damage immunity is applied after the pool and does not refund the opportunity. Reuse the identical cached original faces and resulting damage value for each other recipient’s corresponding later ordinal, while retaining separate clocks, defenses and roots. If every such opportunity ends or is suppressed, no draw is generated. An earlier suppressed recipient never receives a later replay when another recipient generates that ordinal. Creation, caching and cache-hit timing provide no public signal or Fate presentation permission. Each target consumes its own due ordinal even when suppressed; last consumed ordinal ends only that rider. No later source-state change rewrites its original root.',
      'crystalline-growth':'CURRENT CONTACT-DISTANCE COMPLETION — NEW: Accumulate actual distance traveled while the body contacts an active patch during the current regular movement opportunity, including qualified forced motion. Pauses, frame steps and changes of input command do not reset that accumulator. A movement exposure occurs at five total contacted feet after starting inside, not five feet of nominal Speed expenditure; terrain affects paid budget separately. Genuine entry from outside can trigger earlier and then spends the same family cap. Clearing a patch removes its contact volume, HP and damage opportunity for this instance. Each fixed scene-aligned patch is one object identity regardless of how many visual spikes it renders.',
      'storm-sphere':'CURRENT SOURCE-ORIGIN BOUNDARY: The sphere-origin attack permission is authored explicitly by this spell; it is not imported from AC6 Skybrand or a generic remote-origin feature. Owner close-quarters conditions, source-specific hit hooks and the real Bonus Action remain independent checks. The named P20-STORM-REAL-01 example uses actual Mage Undying Spellform to preserve concentration while no Bonus Action is available; no unnamed unconscious-concentration exception is granted.',
      'leeching-plague':'CURRENT HEALING-ELIGIBILITY COMPLETION: Before the proposed hostile-living-nonconstruct donor filter, exclude terminal transferred branches marked no-derived-healing or no-recovery by the actual source. Burden Shared and Life Linked cannot fund this secondary healing. A transfer must have actual access, resources, timing and acceptance; do not manufacture two eligible donors from a symbolic split. Preserve the original IN4-08 examples unchanged as history.',
      'enervation':'CURRENT HEALING-ELIGIBILITY COMPLETION: Exclude any terminal branch whose actual transfer/source flags forbid derived healing or recovery before summing the base-healing pool. The original NE5-06-B arithmetic is conditional on a genuinely permitted split, not a claim that Burden Shared or Life Linked allows it. The two supplied source-qualified vectors show their actual narrower results and retain the original abstract scenario unchanged. Neither vector changes the separate pending broad donor predicate for this spell.',
      'synaptic-static':'CURRENT RNG BOUNDARY: The penalty component is private unless a separately authorized original-roll presentation includes that component. A displayed original d20 event does not automatically expose every modifier cause or grant Fate Coin permission to alter a secret penalty die. Retain each penalty die under the same original resolution through any independently permitted d20 replacement. Exact DE4 event/presentation dependencies remain pending and require refresh before final integration; these rules grant no new reroll or universal visibility.',
    }
    records=[]
